1
00:00:00,336 --> 00:00:01,728
Mirror-Hiding Dragon!

2
00:00:01,728 --> 00:00:03,840
This is where it ends!

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:06,672
I can't believe you managed to find this place!

4
00:00:06,672 --> 00:00:09,216
You're pretty capable yourself!

5
00:00:09,216 --> 00:00:11,232
The show on the stage

6
00:00:11,232 --> 00:00:14,350
is loved by people throughout the town:

7
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:17,232
'The Chameleons of Yunzhou.'

8
00:00:17,232 --> 00:00:19,248
Beelu's family

9
00:00:19,248 --> 00:00:23,760
and all the audience members

10
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:27,312
watch, completely transfixed.

11
00:00:27,312 --> 00:00:28,416
Get him!

12
00:00:28,416 --> 00:00:30,576
Catch that Mirror-Hiding Dragon!

13
00:00:35,904 --> 00:00:37,680
Aw, what a shame!

14
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:39,936
We almost caught him!

15
00:00:41,025 --> 00:00:44,688
It will be quite a while before the second half starts,

16
00:00:44,688 --> 00:00:46,752
so Beelu takes this chance

17
00:00:46,752 --> 00:00:50,256
to look around the neighborhood.

18
00:00:50,256 --> 00:00:51,360
Huh?

19
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:52,320
In a little alley,

20
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:56,928
another stage is putting on a hand-puppet show.

21
00:00:56,928 --> 00:00:57,936
Wow!

22
00:01:01,048 --> 00:01:03,544
Beelu is completely absorbed in the show.

23
00:01:03,544 --> 00:01:05,512
He leans in too close

24
00:01:05,512 --> 00:01:06,952
and suddenly loses his balance,

25
00:01:06,952 --> 00:01:09,832
knocking over the entire stage!

26
00:01:09,832 --> 00:01:10,750
Ouch!

27
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:12,952
Behind the stage,

28
00:01:12,952 --> 00:01:17,272
a pink chameleon has fallen onto the ground.

29
00:01:19,672 --> 00:01:23,275
Hearing the commotion,

30
00:01:23,275 --> 00:01:26,392
passersby hurry over to check on him.

31
00:01:26,392 --> 00:01:28,216
Are you okay?

32
00:01:28,216 --> 00:01:28,792
Huh?

33
00:01:28,792 --> 00:01:31,912
Little Sea, aren't you already an adult?

34
00:01:31,912 --> 00:01:35,475
Yeah! Why haven't you turned red yet?

35
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:40,750
Faced with so many questions, Little Sea can't answer.

36
00:01:40,750 --> 00:01:43,877
He simply takes off running.

37
00:01:43,877 --> 00:01:45,365
The chameleons at the scene

38
00:01:45,365 --> 00:01:49,109
are all bewildered.

39
00:01:49,109 --> 00:01:51,797
Feeling terrible about what happened, Beelu

40
00:01:51,797 --> 00:01:53,957
runs after Little Sea.

41
00:01:54,775 --> 00:01:56,400
He's over...

42
00:01:58,133 --> 00:01:59,050
...here!

43
00:01:59,525 --> 00:02:01,589
Beelu has a keen sense of smell.

44
00:02:01,589 --> 00:02:05,813
He follows Little Sea's scent straight into the woods.

45
00:02:05,813 --> 00:02:06,485
So that's where he went.

46
00:02:06,485 --> 00:02:09,461
Little Sea has hidden inside a tree hollow.

47
00:02:10,575 --> 00:02:12,005
I'm sorry.

48
00:02:12,005 --> 00:02:15,221
I didn't mean to knock you down just now.

49
00:02:15,221 --> 00:02:17,429
What's the use of saying sorry?

50
00:02:17,429 --> 00:02:22,085
You made everyone see that I'm pink!

51
00:02:23,214 --> 00:02:24,702
Where we come from,

52
00:02:24,702 --> 00:02:29,022
adult male chameleons have to turn red.

53
00:02:29,022 --> 00:02:30,030
Huh?

54
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:32,382
Beelu doesn't understand.

55
00:02:32,382 --> 00:02:34,590
He clearly just saw

56
00:02:34,590 --> 00:02:37,710
chameleons of all different colors.

57
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:41,982
Only young chameleons are allowed to change colors freely.

58
00:02:41,982 --> 00:02:43,278
Why?

59
00:02:43,278 --> 00:02:46,734
To help Beelu understand,

60
00:02:46,734 --> 00:02:51,619
Little Sea begins telling him 'The Story of the Bridge.'

61
00:02:51,619 --> 00:02:52,819
Three hundred years ago,

62
00:02:52,819 --> 00:02:56,275
a wide river ran through the middle of Chameleon Town.

63
00:02:56,275 --> 00:02:57,955
The river was very wide,

64
00:02:57,955 --> 00:02:59,971
making it hard to get around.

65
00:02:59,971 --> 00:03:02,371
So the mayor called on two

66
00:03:02,371 --> 00:03:04,003
of the town's most talented chameleons

67
00:03:04,003 --> 00:03:05,923
to build a bridge.

68
00:03:05,923 --> 00:03:08,131
Master Builder Red Tai

69
00:03:08,131 --> 00:03:10,867
and design expert Blue Ying.

70
00:03:10,867 --> 00:03:14,035
The two of them led all the chameleons in town

71
00:03:14,035 --> 00:03:17,400
in building an incredible bridge.

72
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:20,035
Everyone was grateful to them.

73
00:03:20,035 --> 00:03:21,811
And this is that very bridge!

74
00:03:22,772 --> 00:03:27,188
They soon arrive beside the great red bridge.

75
00:03:27,188 --> 00:03:30,125
Beelu suddenly realizes

76
00:03:30,125 --> 00:03:32,775
that compared with the bridge,

77
00:03:32,775 --> 00:03:36,260
he's as tiny as an ant.

78
00:03:36,260 --> 00:03:39,800
Wow! It's amazing!

79
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:41,325
It's a red bridge!

80
00:03:41,325 --> 00:03:43,675
Red is my favorite color!

81
00:03:43,675 --> 00:03:44,668
Is that so...?

82
00:03:44,668 --> 00:03:47,740
But my favorite color is pink.

83
00:03:48,412 --> 00:03:49,612
After saying this, Little Sea

84
00:03:49,612 --> 00:03:52,492
walks into the grass behind him

85
00:03:52,492 --> 00:03:58,225
and continues acting out the story with his hands.

86
00:03:58,225 --> 00:04:01,372
To honor their achievement in building the bridge,

87
00:04:01,372 --> 00:04:05,260
the mayor decreed that all adult chameleons

88
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:08,476
must turn the colors of Red Tai and Blue Ying

89
00:04:08,476 --> 00:04:10,975
and could never change color again for the rest of their lives.

90
00:04:10,975 --> 00:04:14,812
Girls had to turn blue, representing intelligence.

91
00:04:14,812 --> 00:04:18,316
Boys had to turn red, representing passion.

92
00:04:19,900 --> 00:04:21,772
And that's the end of the story.

93
00:04:24,172 --> 00:04:28,828
Little Sea doesn't think he's passionate

94
00:04:28,828 --> 00:04:31,036
and he doesn't like red.

95
00:04:31,036 --> 00:04:31,996
However,

96
00:04:31,996 --> 00:04:36,844
today he becomes an adult chameleon.

97
00:04:36,844 --> 00:04:41,836
Today, he has to perform the coming-of-age play for everyone.

98
00:04:41,836 --> 00:04:43,400
After that, he'll never again be able

99
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:47,150
to turn his favorite color, pink.

100
00:04:47,150 --> 00:04:49,948
This rule is strange.

101
00:04:49,948 --> 00:04:51,532
For hundreds of years,

102
00:04:51,532 --> 00:04:54,268
everyone has followed it.

103
00:04:54,268 --> 00:04:55,612
What's strange about it?

104
00:04:58,925 --> 00:05:01,350
Beelu can't answer.

105
00:05:01,350 --> 00:05:03,676
Inside the tree hollow, Little Sea

106
00:05:03,676 --> 00:05:07,516
curls up into a ball.

107
00:05:10,748 --> 00:05:13,820
Little Sea says nothing.

108
00:05:13,820 --> 00:05:17,900
Beelu quietly sits beside him to keep him company.

109
00:05:19,628 --> 00:05:22,364
A long time passes.

110
00:05:22,364 --> 00:05:26,876
The clouds in the sky grow thicker,

111
00:05:26,876 --> 00:05:30,956
blocking out the sunlight.

112
00:05:30,956 --> 00:05:31,916
Ah!

113
00:05:31,916 --> 00:05:35,516
I know why this rule is strange!

114
00:05:35,516 --> 00:05:37,300
Why is it strange?

115
00:05:37,300 --> 00:05:39,350
It makes your heart hurt.

116
00:05:39,350 --> 00:05:40,556
That's not right.

117
00:05:42,262 --> 00:05:47,300
Sunlight shines through the thin clouds

118
00:05:47,300 --> 00:05:50,825
and falls at an angle on Little Sea,

119
00:05:50,825 --> 00:05:54,726
making him glow pink.

120
00:05:54,726 --> 00:05:57,366
Pink really suits you.

121
00:06:01,014 --> 00:06:03,078
Hearing Beelu's words,

122
00:06:03,078 --> 00:06:06,150
Little Sea is deeply moved

123
00:06:06,150 --> 00:06:11,238
and decides to invite Beelu to perform the coming-of-age play with him.

124
00:06:12,390 --> 00:06:13,062
It turns out

125
00:06:13,062 --> 00:06:15,174
the coming-of-age play in their town

126
00:06:15,174 --> 00:06:17,958
is 'The Story of the Bridge.'

127
00:06:17,958 --> 00:06:22,278
Little Sea makes a small change to the story

128
00:06:22,278 --> 00:06:25,878
and gives Beelu the role of the Bridge Spirit.

129
00:06:26,502 --> 00:06:29,046
The story reaches its final scene.

130
00:06:29,046 --> 00:06:30,774
Just as the mayor announces

131
00:06:30,774 --> 00:06:35,850
the rule that adult chameleons must change color,

132
00:06:35,850 --> 00:06:40,800
the bridge suddenly comes to life!

133
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:43,390
Ahem, Mayor!

134
00:06:43,390 --> 00:06:45,196
Everyone in town helped build the bridge.

135
00:06:45,196 --> 00:06:48,412
That's right!

136
00:06:48,412 --> 00:06:49,325
Yellow Three worked so hard carrying the stones.

137
00:06:49,325 --> 00:06:52,500
And Green Two cooked meals for everyone!

138
00:06:52,500 --> 00:06:56,236
Mm-hmm! Mm-hmm!

139
00:06:56,236 --> 00:06:57,292
The mayor thinks for a moment.

140
00:06:57,975 --> 00:07:01,141
Hmm... You make a good point.

141
00:07:01,141 --> 00:07:04,213
Then let's do away with that rule!

142
00:07:04,213 --> 00:07:07,381
And that's the end of the story.

143
00:07:08,675 --> 00:07:11,557
Pink Little Sea

144
00:07:13,604 --> 00:07:15,428
and Beelu step onstage together to take their bows.

145
00:07:15,428 --> 00:07:20,900
The audience says nothing.

146
00:07:20,900 --> 00:07:24,925
The whole place falls silent.

147
00:07:24,925 --> 00:07:27,188
Suddenly,

148
00:07:27,977 --> 00:07:29,177
someone starts clapping.

149
00:07:29,177 --> 00:07:31,625
It's Beelu's mom!

150
00:07:31,625 --> 00:07:34,409
Wonderful! That was a great performance!

151
00:07:34,409 --> 00:07:37,049
In an instant,

152
00:07:37,049 --> 00:07:37,961
applause erupts all around them.

153
00:07:37,961 --> 00:07:40,975
Everyone thinks Little Sea is very brave.

154
00:07:40,975 --> 00:07:44,537
Actually, I like yellow!

155
00:07:44,537 --> 00:07:47,465
I like green!

156
00:07:47,465 --> 00:07:49,481
We should be able to choose our own colors!

157
00:07:49,481 --> 00:07:52,619
It turns out

158
00:07:52,619 --> 00:07:53,579
everyone had wanted to get rid of the rule for a long time,

159
00:07:53,579 --> 00:07:58,043
but no one had been brave enough to speak up first.

160
00:07:58,043 --> 00:08:03,323
The chameleons in the street

161
00:08:03,323 --> 00:08:05,325
begin changing into the colors they like.

162
00:08:05,325 --> 00:08:11,387
You can keep being a pink chameleon!

163
00:08:11,387 --> 00:08:14,425
Yay! That's great!

164
00:08:14,425 --> 00:08:16,379
The sun comes out again.

165
00:08:22,725 --> 00:08:24,275
Beelu says goodbye to Little Sea

166
00:08:24,275 --> 00:08:26,975
and gets ready to go home.

167
00:08:26,975 --> 00:08:28,850
Bye-bye!

168
00:08:28,850 --> 00:08:30,443
You made a good friend today!

169
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:37,883
Yeah!

170
00:08:37,883 --> 00:08:39,225
Today was so much fun!

171
00:08:39,225 --> 00:08:41,051
Today, Beelu visited Yunlin.

172
00:08:47,675 --> 00:08:51,467
He watched 'The Chameleons of Yunzhou'

173
00:08:51,467 --> 00:08:54,635
and performed a puppet show with Little Sea.

174
00:08:54,635 --> 00:08:58,475
Because of the mayor's rule, Little Sea

175
00:08:58,475 --> 00:09:01,595
wasn't allowed to turn the color he liked.

176
00:09:01,595 --> 00:09:05,387
Do you think the mayor should decide

177
00:09:05,387 --> 00:09:06,525
what color Little Sea has to be?

178
00:09:06,525 --> 00:09:09,371
If you were Little Sea,

179
00:09:09,371 --> 00:09:10,427
who do you think should have the right

180
00:09:10,427 --> 00:09:13,067
to decide your color?

181
00:09:13,067 --> 00:09:16,283
The video is over!

182
00:09:17,387 --> 00:09:20,171
After watching,

183
00:09:20,171 --> 00:09:22,400
don't forget to close your eyes

184
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:25,975
and give them a little rest!
